{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0133_1000_p", "source_sha256": "430b5a548e6ac521a542823b884a68f48d7a9d529856e8d80d7f0d9443482723", "ja": "（人気特撮番組『アイドルヒーローズ』は、劇場版の\n評判も上々だ。さて、海美の様子はどうかな……）", "zh": "（人气特摄节目《偶像英雄联盟》的电影版\n评价也相当不错，去看看海美的状况如何吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0133_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "75fd4735ac70d345c4a522616ade99a6b3dfa6ea172303e15ffe670bd56853b4", "ja": "食らえ！\nキネティックパンチ・ビクトリィィィーッ！！", "zh": "接招吧！\n动能拳击‧胜利之拳──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0133_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f55b858e9680553fddd62048f1f651cb52574b75445b2773852ad7f80439ba90", "ja": "うおっ！　な、なんだ！？", "zh": "呜喔！怎、怎么回事！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0133_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "b1111fa5b834d9003a70d55b49560d8ecf73d5e2c106faa09e0825ae7c3aade5", "ja": "あーっ！？　ごめん、{$P$}！\n大丈夫？　ケガとかしてない？", "zh": "啊～！？对不起，{$P$}！\n你还好吗？有没有受伤？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0133_1004_p", "source_sha256": "7783b67867b7f8e0123006b6c8b7bc91bf7353213ffd2036bb5de6e5e2bf0178", "ja": "いや、当たってないから大丈夫だけど……\nいきなりだから、びっくりしたよ。", "zh": "没有啦，我没被打到所以没事……\n只是突然一拳招呼过来，吓了我一跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0133_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3a5bd4c8eaf3ca895c0cb43117dbf0fc8de6137f16661baec73f6fd26f4efecc", "ja": "それより……今のは、『アイドルヒーローズ』での\n海美の必殺技だよな？", "zh": "话说回来……刚刚那是你在\n《偶像英雄联盟》里的必杀技对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0133_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "a0d1858f5060ce6b0637a44928fd77f7cbcab0399e1dade8711c7936e99d13f6", "ja": "うん、そう！　ちょ～っと声出そうかなー？って\n思ったら、つい熱くなっちゃって……えへへ♪", "zh": "嗯，没错！本想说稍～微喊个几声，\n结果一不小心就激动起来了……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0133_1007_p", "source_sha256": "4dd53e0bf2174be841d7e7fbc7fd2c4f84a7019e70f36fb26c7fe596fa903daa", "ja": "練習熱心なのはいい事だけど、大声を出したり\n体を動かすなら、レッスンルームに行こう。", "zh": "积极练习是好事，\n但如果要大喊或活动身体的话，还是去练习室吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0133_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d5b1b8812ec2dd82b107c08ef6c4ef36eb3368dd1d2d059672554f792fda03d2", "ja": "狭い場所で練習して、\n海美にケガでもされたら困るからな！", "zh": "要是在狭窄的空间练习，\n让你不小心受伤，那就不好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0133_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "b7303d3ca89134f0b814ed2def452e2d6ad1e303585483c48bd7aca3dbaff14b", "ja": "うん！　次からそうするね！\n{$P$}に心配されちゃった、えへへ♪", "zh": "嗯！我下次会记得的！\n让{$P$}担心了，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0133_1010_p", "source_sha256": "fff6a37ef1e1a877fe2890b952dcc91f6968c4f2e347edab2c5a3ba97e6189e2", "ja": "海美は『アイドルヒーローズ』で大活躍だったもんな。\nアクションもセリフも多くて……。", "zh": "海美你在《偶像英雄联盟》的表现非常亮眼嘛，\n动作戏和台词都很多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0133_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "e235cd2f944cd59a2972fde718efac1000f65ed5e45e72f52d9a6b2e43525ed6", "ja": "うん！　大変だったけど、すっごく楽しかったー！\nあ、でもひとつだけ、困ったことがあって……。", "zh": "嗯！虽然很辛苦，但也很开心～！\n啊，但有一个地方让我很苦恼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0133_1012_p", "source_sha256": "b62f3c54f43c7e31e816e1fd7ae608c43519eee64be957e0f4b4c824708d4989", "ja": "困った事？", "zh": "苦恼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0133_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "86aa28fb9fc5d572544911d5154508bd63d03112939bd06f9d825e9d9570a4ae", "ja": "最後の対決シーン、長いセリフを言いながら\nアクションするところがあるでしょ？", "zh": "最后的对决场面，不是有个地方\n要一边说很长的台词，一边演出动作戏吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0133_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "e55eb4c43d2a7178df13803b2f7000f833fabff68d48a5ed8b7c72751698dbec", "ja": "あそこで、いつもセリフ間違えそうになって\n大変だったんだー。", "zh": "那一幕我每次都差点讲错台词，\n超难演的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0133_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "6b516b826cd0ea73cb977d993249c478c01dab8fbab0d41963c327e568592884", "ja": "体と頭、どっちに集中すればいいのか、\n頭がこんがらがっちゃって……。", "zh": "完全不晓得该把精神集中在身体还是脑袋，\n脑中老是一团乱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0133_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "7fb884c379cf642ef2dea9d5330f81d4d06bf948b8022042786d01a42590950c", "ja": "ねえ{$P$}、アクションシーンの\nセリフを覚えるのに、いい方法ってないのかな？", "zh": "对了，{$P$}，\n你有没有什么好方法，可以记住动作戏的台词呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0133_1017_p", "source_sha256": "0ebe0de57f023813a779156f0b941fe2712d74d5a0f1d6d4fa040ee63cffd475", "ja": "そうだな。そういう時は……。", "zh": "这个嘛，这时候应该……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0133_1018", "source_sha256": "d3f42b199cc67ea993783e8e9a26865274d5236302d5ad4af7e6ac066d7c356f", "ja": "体で覚える！", "zh": "靠身体记住！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0133_2000_p", "source_sha256": "5b272799e0884b0684ca3c5e10b0b45d3449086bcc9765182b3eb923f4c38583", "ja": "セリフとアクションをセットで、体で覚えるのが\nいいんだろうな……簡単じゃないとは思うけど。", "zh": "把台词和动作结合起来，靠身体记住吧……\n虽然做起来应该不简单。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0133_2001_029umi", "source_sha256": "f814a4a773cd14f3c629bd0d596f172b90c59b6aac604a0cdc897296de0fdbcd", "ja": "やっぱ、そうか～。でも私、体で覚えるのは\n得意なほうだから……なんとかなるかも！？", "zh": "果然要这样啊～但我算是比较擅长靠身体记忆……\n说不定真的可行！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0133_2002_029umi", "source_sha256": "dce4ffe3f86f92da5f3c73faba409f66f6dc9d63bcfef0b80736856478ded9e2", "ja": "いくぞー！　キネティックパワー！\nオーバー……ブーストッ！", "zh": "开始啰～！动能威力！\n超越……增幅！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0133_2003_p", "source_sha256": "73e7255d89f623ea7d7a1d0307fa9967daaca9a1e228e93e53315de9f4abc1b5", "ja": "うん。やる気があるのはいい事だけど、海美。\n大声を出すなら、レッスンルームでな……。", "zh": "嗯，有干劲是件好事，但是海美，\n如果要大喊的话，还是去练习室吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
